The previous landing, landing-pr-for-697-slice-b-432-s-1c885460, judged 3cc5faa4 and held on a queued-provenance HIGH. A queued entry on a shelf its admitting process does not place composed with no origin for that shelf's layers, past the refusal of a name on both shelves. Its other findings were verified on the code then and still hold.

