  - (g) the per-round commits squash-merge to one contribution under decision 0051.
- 2026-10-17, on PR #722 (slice A): all six accepted. Slice B follows with ruling 3 and ruling 5.
- #697's rulings 2, 3, 4 and 5 (read #697's body whole), and the 2026-09-26 threat model: catch realistic accidental misuse, and fail closed on what cannot be read. Decision 0071 rulings 3, 5, 8 and 9.

THE BRANCH SINCE THE PREVIOUS LANDING (story-697-slice-b, on main 68c41bcd):
- 78abaa94, fix round 697b4 (fix-round-697b4-for-story-697-sl-4a3181ae; review residual LOW, no security residual):
  - LaunchError::QueuedShelfUnplaced, refused by refuse_unplaced_shelf in launch/queued.rs, both at admission and at QueuedLaunch::rebuild's start;
