4. Nothing of main's is reverted. engine.rs differs from main in the two run_started payload lines only, and `quality/ratchet.sh clones` prints "duplication holds".
5. Scope: no contracts/, fixtures/, policy/ or reference/ change, and no witness digest moves.
6. For the PR: confirm the asks are (a) to (g) as above, all ruled. Name 697b4's public-api items exactly. Name any NEW ask beyond the ruling.

This run lands one pull request under decision 0051, so the contribution gate can vouch for it.

KNOWN FLAKE, not this branch's: engine::broker::admission::tests::every_steps_door_rechecks_the_lease_its_attempt_holds (crates/brokkr-runtime/src/engine/broker/admission/tests.rs:1408) can fail inside the verify box with cleanup "unresolved", "processes … the engine adopted could not be attributed to one attempt". It is decision 0065 slice two's test, and its owner has been told. This branch changes nothing under engine/broker/.

